dialogue greenvalley_smith
title: A smith who said no
trigger: StageCleared greenvalley-03
speaker smith - name=Blacksmith portrait=tinkerer
speaker commander $commander

node hail smith
  That's a Choir wagon. And you're not Choir.
  -> reply

node reply commander
  You noticed. Are you going to turn us in?
  -> ask

node ask smith
  The Choir asked me to forge their tithe chains. I said no. I'll fix your gear if you take me with you.
  * Deal. -> joined
    do: JoinNpc blacksmith
  * Prove you're any good. -> proof

node proof smith
  Hand me your worst blade. There. Sharper than when you bought it.
  do: JoinNpc blacksmith
  -> joined

node joined smith
  The Captain's beaten, and the tithe still goes up the old road to the Still. Let's go and see where it ends.
